{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-genius","title":"早年与天才","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-tinkerer-and-thinker","title":"修补匠与思想家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/a-tinkerer-and-thinker","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"mit-and-the-masters-thesis","title":"麻省理工与硕士论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/mit-and-the-masters-thesis","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"早年与天才\">早年与天才</h1><p>本章讲述香农的早年与天才。香农，自幼既是一位热爱动手的修补匠，又是一位善于思考的思想家；他在麻省理工撰写了被誉为&quot;二十世纪最重要的硕士论文&quot;,奠定了数字电路的理论基础。两篇文档，分别呈现修补匠与思想家，以及麻省理工与硕士论文。</p>\n"}